# 11. DASHBOARD UI/UX

Gunakan gaya Modern Enterprise SaaS Dashboard.

Design guidelines:
- Sidebar profesional.
- White/Light content background.
- Navy sidebar.
- Blue primary.
- Teal secondary.
- Colorful KPI cards.
- Responsive layout.
- Lucide icons.
- Chart.js.
- Clean typography.
- Konsisten pada semua halaman.

Dashboard KPI:
- Total Sales.
- Total Inventory.
- Inventory Value.
- Pending SO.
- Outstanding AR.
- Available ICCID.

Charts:
- Sales Performance.
- Sales by Area.
- Inventory by Product Type.
- Stock by Warehouse.
- Payment Method.
- Top Sales Performance.

Widgets:
- Recent Transactions.
- Low Stock Alert.
- Pending Approval.
- Latest Stock Movement.
- Top Selling Products.

Gunakan data dummy realistis untuk demo jika data transaksi belum tersedia. Bedakan data dummy dengan transaksi aktual dan jangan mencampur angka dummy ke dalam laporan transaksi aktual.

